<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Refund Policy – Carbon</title>
  <%- include('style') %>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Carbon Gym · Last updated: <%= lastUpdated %></p>

    <p>This policy applies to membership packages bought from Carbon Gym, whether paid in the Carbon app or at the front
      desk.</p>

    <h2>Unused packages</h2>
    <p>If you haven't used any session of a package, you can ask for a full refund. Contact us<% if (contactEmail) { %>
      at <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a> or<% } %> at the front desk of any Carbon branch with
      the name and email on your account.</p>

    <h2>Used packages</h2>
    <p><strong>Once any session of a package has been used</strong> (a check-in or an attended class booking), the package
      can no longer be refunded.</p>

    <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Payments made in the app are refunded to the same card or wallet you paid with, through our payment provider
        Paymob. Depending on your bank, it usually appears within 7–14 business days.</li>
      <li>Payments made at the front desk are refunded at the front desk.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Failed or duplicate payments</h2>
    <p>If you were charged but your package wasn't activated, or you were charged twice for the same package, contact us
      and we will activate the package or refund the extra payment.</p>

    <p class="muted"><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/support">Support</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
